# WP-055 golden: Aether Dart hits the dummy 7 m ahead (record with `lf-tools replay record-script`). Each line:
# <ticks> <move_x> <move_z> [BUTTONS], plus `cmd` lines. The player rests at the Lantern,
# raises Insight by 2 (the spell's requirement), attunes the spell to the first
# attunement slot (slot 32), and casts it. Stylus, Glimmer, and known spells come from
# the `spell_range` scenario.
seed 5501
scenario spell_range
10 0 0            # settle on the ground
cmd Rest
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd Equip 32 15000      # attune
2 0 0
1 0 0 LIGHT     # the dart leaves on frame 7
60 0 0
